{"id":"diez","lemma":"diez","pos":"noun","rank":409,"glosses":["A (highest grade in testing)"],"ipa":"/ˈdjeθ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"dieces"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/91/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-diez.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él tiene diez vacas.","en":"He has ten cows.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/37730"},{"text":"Volveré a las diez.","en":"I'll be back at ten.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449787"},{"text":"Ella tiene diez hijos.","en":"She has ten children.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/68074"},{"text":"Te debo diez dólares.","en":"I owe you ten dollars.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453445"},{"text":"Él habla diez idiomas.","en":"He speaks ten languages.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461406"}]}